Comparison of 3code to competition
==================================

zcode
-----

negative

  No auto retry on network failure- not very agentic

  usage is hard to see (could be by design)

  git is inflexible- you can branch without a full lock

  detailed sandboxing is not agentic- like claude code without its LLM guard

Positive

  Displays thinking very nicely in ephemeral GUI bubble

  The auto formatting is great

  git integration is extremely convenient

  repo wiki is cool but might be expensive


